{
  "_doc": "Retrieval probes over the Harbour Lights fixture corpus (tests/fixtures/corpus) and the craft knowledge base. A probe passes at k if any of its top-k hits matches one 'expect' entry: same file (production docs) or source path (craft), and, when given, a heading containing 'heading' (case-insensitive). Write probes the way a crew member would ask, not in the documents' own words.",
  "production": [
    {"id": "sell-boat", "query": "Who wants to sell the family boat?",
